  "legal_principles": [
    {
      "principle": "Criminality attaches to the act of second marriage by a husband or wife who has a living spouse.",
      "held": "When a law, such as Section 11 of Hindu Marriage Act, 1955 declares that a second marriage by a husband, who has living wife, with another woman is void, for breach of Section 5 (i) of the said Act, it brings/attaches several legal disabilities to the woman with whom second marriage is performed.",
